<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec lead imports fall 17.3 pct yr/yr--MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec lead imports fall 17.3 pct yr/yr--MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined lead imports in December fell 17.3 percent from a year earlier to 877 tonnes, Ministry of Finance data issued on Monday showed.</p>
<p>The following is a breakdown (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Dec 96	    Nov 96	   Dec 95</p>
<p> Total		877	     1,921	    1,061</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> China		192	     1,260		  0</p>
<p> Peru		 265		 228		169</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in 1996 were 33,334 tonnes, down a steep 55.5 percent from 74,824 tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
